Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xr-hand-tracking (>= 0.1.0), xr-hexagonrpc-daemon (>= 0.5.1)
Description: Optional original-weight Quest Hexagon hand backend
 Contains the DSP client and host decoder, including CC BY-NC 4.0 UmeTrack
 geometry adaptations. Proprietary model weights, DSP binaries and private
 camera calibration are imported separately and are not included.
